    "long_instructions": "# Investigate\r\n\r\nThis is the same program from the last level. \r\n\r\nTry doing one or more of these small changes: \r\n- add a second `take_paint()`\r\n- swap an `and` for an `or`\r\n- add a `not` somewhere — .\r\n\r\nMake one small change at a time and predict what will change before you run. ",
